---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="contact section" id="contact">
  <div class="container contact__inner" data-reveal>
    <p class="contact__kicker">24 hours, 365 days</p>
    <h2 class="contact__title">まずは、ご相談ください。</h2>
    <p class="contact__lead">ご相談・ご予約は24時間365日受け付けています。<br class="contact__break" />深夜・早朝も、落ち着いてお電話ください。</p>
    <div class="contact__actions">
      <a class="contact__phone" href="tel:0427034986">
        <Icon name="phone" class="contact__phone-icon" />
        <span class="contact__phone-copy">
          <span class="contact__phone-label">24時間365日受付</span>
          <strong class="contact__phone-number">042-703-4986</strong>
        </span>
      </a>
      <a class="button contact__line" href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/@971qlchl?ts=09091308&oat_content=url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <Icon name="line" class="button__icon" />LINEで相談する
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
